  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Removes synth-muscle limiters, allowing absurdly powerful strikes.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Gorilla Arms Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> This enhancement does not count toward the amount of Cyberware Enhancements installed into the Gorilla Arms. While Combat Software (Limiter Removal) is installed, if the user has made at least one successful attack during the previous 2 Rounds with Gorilla Arms, Limiter Removal is charged. Limiter Removal may then may be used at any time in the remaining combat encounter as a ROF 1 Attack with any of the Gorilla Arms’ modes (if they have any alternate modes).</p>\n<p>If a Limiter Removal attack hits, the Gorilla Arm deals 3d6 additional damage (6d6 / 7d6 Tungsten Reinforcement / 9d6 Hydraulic Ram). Any standing or upright victim of this attack must also beat a DV19 Athletics Check to not be immediately knocked Prone.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Gorilla Arms<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
